        "description": "Runs on the person's computer with the rights they granted it to see the programs running there and to stop one. Give programs (the picked list tool:choose-programs-left-running answered) and optionally grace_ms (how long to wait for each to end, 10000 when not given, at most 60000). Each program is asked to end (SIGTERM) only when the same program is still there (the same pid and start time); nothing is forced. Returns stops (one per program: address, pid, started_at_ms, name, command, rule, why, asked_at, ended_at and outcome: ended, still-running, already-gone, not-the-same-program or not-allowed) and notices (one notice for the sweep when any program ended, none otherwise).",
